            "review_title": "Review at Twilight Bar",
            "review_text": "Helmut S\nBerlin, Germany67 contributions\n0\nBeautiful evening with magnificent views of Saigon\nAug 2024 • Couples\nWe had received the Recommendation from fellow travelers and want to make our last evening in Vietnam especially beautiful. Around 6pm we arrived and decided to sit at the top of the parapet. The drinks were great, the waiter's Recommendation turned out to be a great tip. In addition, there were small calves, which were also refilled on request. We order two snacks and French fries and two glasses of red wine, plus a bottle of Pellegrino, which we had placed in a champagne cooler. So we were able to witness how the city slid into the dark with more and more light and with good food and drink. When a rain shower came, we continued the evening two floors down at the open bar. \nA nice conclusion to our Vietnam trip. Recommended at any time.\nRead more\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten August 23, 2024",
